Dear Fabio and Colleagues,

Thank you for your email below on the intervention logic for Corridor 11 and your kind remarks.


Please find attached our first concept note on Corridor 11 (both MS Word and pdf versions), submitted by DEL-UGANDA, for your kind action. Our colleagues in DEL-SOUTH SUDAN are also working on a second concept note
 which we hope to submit in the 2nd round i.e. 15th May 2024.


With regard to the preparatory work for hard infrastructure projects, we confirm, for the moment, that DEL-UGANDA does not have any funding needs for the feasibility/ preparatory studies as these studies are funded
 from national MIP.

We remain at your disposal should require any clarifications on our concept note.

 

 

Kind regards,

Fiona NAKASIGA
 


